  GEOMETRY_WITHIN_MATERIAL_DISTANCE_TOLERANCE:['The geometry difference stays within the material-change distance tolerance','几何差异未超过实质变化距离门槛'],
  SPATIAL_EXTENT_BELOW_MATERIAL_LENGTH:['The displaced segment is shorter than the minimum material-change extent','发生偏移的连续区间不足实质变化所需长度'],
  SUSTAINED_SAME_TARGET_GEOMETRY_CHANGE:['The same target has a sustained displacement over sufficient length','同一对象在足够长的连续区间内发生位移'],
